1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,027
Every puzzle tells a story.

2
00:00:02,047 --> 00:00:04,108
And every story is brand new.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:08,953
Welcome to The Fantastical Logic Grid!

4
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,940
Pick from fourteen worlds.

5
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:18,217
Spooky mysteries, secret agents, fantasy and sci-fi,
Around Town, National Parks, and more.

6
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:22,666
Then choose your challenge, from Basic all the way
up to Quantum Physicist.

7
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:27,332
Press Generate, and a one-of-a-kind story is written
just for you.

8
00:00:27,352 --> 00:00:29,712
No two cases are ever the same.

9
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:34,279
Meet the characters, and hear the clues they
remember, read aloud.

10
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:40,583
Then dive into the grid. Mark an X to rule something
out, and an O to lock in a match.

11
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:45,673
Stuck? Smart hints guide you step by step, without
spoiling the fun.

12
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:49,300
Every section you finish brings the scene to life,

13
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,991
until you crack the case!

14
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:54,023
Race friends on the very same puzzle.

15
00:00:54,043 --> 00:00:57,512
Share a code, or challenge any player by screen
name.

16
00:00:58,250 --> 00:01:03,286
Every solve earns points, so climb the weekly
scoreboard and claim the top spot!

17
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:05,809
Print any puzzle with its answer key.

18
00:01:05,829 --> 00:01:11,141
Your progress saves automatically, and a free
account syncs it across your devices.

19
00:01:11,750 --> 00:01:17,135
Play in light, dark, or high contrast, with full
keyboard and screen reader support.

20
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:21,922
Play free in your browser, or install the Windows
desktop app.

21
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:25,797
The Fantastical Logic Grid.

22
00:01:25,817 --> 00:01:29,609
Your next case is waiting at thelogicgrid.com!

